<%- include('../partials/head', {theme}) %>
<%- include('../partials/navbar') %>
<div class="container" style="padding-top: var(--s-12); max-width: 720px;">
  <div class="section-label">Crisis Resources</div>
  <h1 class="italic-serif mb-4">You are not alone.</h1>
  <p class="text-2 mb-8">If you or someone you know is in crisis, these resources are available 24/7. Reaching out is a sign of strength.</p>
  <div class="crisis-banner mb-8">
    <div class="crisis-banner__icon"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M10.29 3.86L1.82 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 0 0 1.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 0 0-3.42 0z"/><line x1="12" y1="9" x2="12" y2="13"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"/></svg></div>
    <div class="crisis-banner__text"><strong>If you are in immediate danger, call 112 (India emergency number) or go to your nearest emergency room.</strong></div>
  </div>
  <div class="card mb-4"><div class="card-label" style="color:var(--error);">Emergency</div><p style="font-size:24px;font-weight:600;color:var(--error);">112</p><p class="text-2" style="font-size:14px;">National emergency number — available 24/7</p></div>
  <div class="card mb-4"><div class="card-label">iCall — TISS</div><p style="font-size:24px;font-weight:600;color:var(--brand);">9152987821</p><p class="text-2" style="font-size:14px;">Free mental health helpline · Mon-Sat, 8 AM - 10 PM</p></div>
  <div class="card mb-4"><div class="card-label">Vandrevala Foundation</div><p style="font-size:24px;font-weight:600;color:var(--brand);">1860-2662-345</p><p class="text-2" style="font-size:14px;">24/7 mental health support</p></div>
  <div class="card mb-4"><div class="card-label">NIMHANS</div><p style="font-size:24px;font-weight:600;color:var(--brand);">080-46110007</p><p class="text-2" style="font-size:14px;">National Institute of Mental Health helpline · 24/7</p></div>
  <div class="card mb-4"><div class="card-label">AASRA</div><p style="font-size:24px;font-weight:600;color:var(--brand);">9820466726</p><p class="text-2" style="font-size:14px;">Suicide prevention helpline · 24/7</p></div>
  <div class="note note--error mt-8"><strong>If you are thinking about hurting yourself:</strong> Please call one of these numbers right now. You don't have to go through this alone. The people on these lines are trained to listen and help.</div>
</div>
<%- include('../partials/footer') %>